BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:General Assembly
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/general-assembly-hs26/\n<strong>Location:</strong> UZH + Online (members will get an invitation with location information)\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Klára Kolářová (<a class="link" href="mailto:klara.kolarova@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">klara.kolarova@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• This event was rescheduled from 29. Sep to 6. Oct.\n\nOn September 29th we will host a General Assembly (GA). We will look back at our activities of the last year, discuss the direction the society should take and elect a new board. In addition, we will vote on the new version of the statutes.
