END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Sightseeing trip to Lac Léman
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/lac-leman-trip/\n<strong>Location:</strong> Lac Léman (Montreux, Lausanne)\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Ondřej Peterka (<a class="link" href="mailto:ondrej.peterka@email.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ondrej.peterka@email.cz</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41782382184">+41 78 238 21 84</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/HV7kJe9bxrG7oEXw8eK7nR?mode=gi_t" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Whatsapp Group</a>\n\n<p>After the great success of the excursion to Ticino last autumn, we are bringing you another sightseeing tour. This time, we will explore the beauty of the banks of Lac Léman in the french-speaking canton of Vaud. We will start our trip by visiting the Château de Chillon (entrance fee 12,5 Fr. for students). Then we will move to nearby Montreux where we will check out the lake promenade with a famous statue of Freddie Mercury. For lunch, we will grab some food in the centre. Afterwards we will embark on a boat to get back to the city of Lausanne while admiring the characteristic vineyards (even part of the UNESCO World Heritage) from the surface of the lake. In Lausanne we can stroll through the city centre and visit the cathedral or the Olympia museum.</p>
UID:20260523T070000-lac-leman-trip@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20260523T000000
DTSTART:20260523T070000
DTEND:20260523T200000
LOCATION:Lac Léman (Montreux, Lausanne)
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/lac-leman-trip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Hot dogs (Párek v rohlíku)
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/parek/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/hVLRLxZ5p19p8rrHA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KOL-K-Küche (outside if the weather is nice)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Max Kellenberger (<a class="link" href="mailto:max.kellenberger@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">max.kellenberger@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/8tX5R2m8p5y4pPzC7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p>Do you also reminisce of the old days when life seemed oh so simple? 😌 When afternoons were filled with exploration and little adventures. One of those childhood adventures might just have been grabbing a hot dog otherwise known as &ldquo;párek v rohlíku&rdquo; and sitting in the sun talking about what cartoon you are going to watch when you get home.</p> <p>If you want to experience a small taste of the past alongside that of a real párek v rohlíku (and Czech beer 🍻, of course), then you are wholeheartedly invited to come to this transformative experience, bring your friends and loved ones, it will be a feast unlike anything UZH has seen before.</p>
UID:20260508T173000-parek@cssz.ch
