BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Christmas Gingerbread Baking
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/pernik/\n<strong>Location:</strong> Paul-Feyerabend-Hof, 8049 Zürich, Student Village (Common Room)\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Max Kellenberger (<a class="link" href="mailto:max.kellenberger@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">max.kellenberger@cssz.ch</a>), Klára Kolářová (<a class="link" href="mailto:klara.kolarova@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">klara.kolarova@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/3jHRnLG5sfQ6S1aG7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration required</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• Limited to 20 participants due to capacity reasons.\n\n<p><strong>Christmas Gingerbread Baking</strong></p> <p>As is tradition in the Czech and Slovak republics before Christmas, we will be baking gingerbread in various sizes and shapes. Come and join us for an evening full of creativity, mulled wine and Christmas atmosphere!</p> <p>  <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,&#43;gEAAwEBAQEBAQEBAQAAAAAAAAECAwQFBgcICQoLEQACAQIEBAMEBwUEBAABAncAAQIDEQQFITEGEkFRB2FxEyIygQgUQpGhscEJIzNS8BVictEKFiQ04SXxFxgZGiYnKCkqNTY3ODk6Q0RFRkdISUpTVFVWV1hZWmNkZWZnaGlqc3R1dnd4eXqCg4SFhoeIiYqSk5SVlpeYmZqio6Slpqeoqaqys7S1tre4ubrCw8TFxsfIycrS09TV1tfY2dri4&#43;Tl5ufo6ery8/T19vf4&#43;fr/2gAMAwEAAhEDEQA/AOr1XV9J0y&#43;aG4UsVIyGJUYJ656HFZGreKZ0hRLKBoI4pAoM5Lqitn5uOnT9a4PxNoOoTeJftF1KLpbpAbra20ID91BnqeM5FO8TW1/baIrGc7XCRyJ0AwMDoea5b3aVzpaS6Hb2PiK5lWYT6jEWjlKAw4CkYH19atf243/QRP5j/CvJhqQsY44IkniQLkKr/n39c0f26/8Afuf&#43;&#43;/8A69YVIS53Zs1hOPKro//Z); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_3bb0acc1c4e512df.webp 2048w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_3bb0acc1c4e512df.webp 2048w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_a75232280c57a3b2.webp 640w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_ff1543bf35af9e20.webp 1024w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_fa69f62df3da038c.webp 1600w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_5b2f8f77ab168982.webp 2000w'                     sizes="(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_96f32c9d06425167.jpeg 2048w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_96f32c9d06425167.jpeg 2048w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_c747b464ed58f2e8.jpeg 640w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_351f10840ee5b5dc.jpeg 1024w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_f8b63414d39668c2.jpeg 1600w, /images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_42a1cb3986ee4283.jpeg 2000w'                     sizes="(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2024-12-06-gingerbread/ginger_group_hu_96f32c9d06425167.jpeg"                  width="2048"                  height="1536"                                                       alt="Gingerbread Group 2024"                               /></picture> </p>
