LOCATION;ALTREP="https://maps.app.goo.gl/jbaMyd8VYPYQ1Dbj7":Saffa-Insel
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/summer-grill/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Jam Session
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/jamming-session/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1qYm5MY4yq24GU6v7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Probsteistrasse 99, Zurich (close to Bahnhof Stettbach)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Matěj Mrázek (<a class="link" href="mailto:mrazekmates@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mrazekmates@gmail.com</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;420734643958">+420734643958</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfX30AiFDOuVTM_1R8seFAR85WoiNnuGRMv4J05M_MTgcApHQ/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=104836480148266218699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p>Join a great evening of playing guitar, piano &amp; singing! We shall meet on <strong>Tuesday, June 3, 2024</strong>, from <strong>19:00 to 23:00</strong>. Everybody is welcome, no matter how much experience with music you have :D</p> <h2 id="instruments"><strong>Instruments</strong></h2> <p>A piano and a guitar are already present, I&rsquo;ll be really happy if you bring any instruments you enjoy playing as well.</p> <h2 id="registration--disclaimer"><strong>Registration &amp; Disclaimer</strong></h2> <p>You can register using the link above. The entrance is free, though if you have some spare time on the way here, please stop at Coop and bring some food/beer!</p>
