URL:https://cssz.ch/events/jamming-session/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Walk around Oberweningen
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/walk-oberweningen/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsJRJDukk3GNd1gX7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Oberweningen</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Ondřej Peterka (<a class="link" href="mailto:ondrej.peterka@email.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ondrej.peterka@email.cz</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41782382184">+41 78 238 21 84</a>)\n\n<p>Join us for a chill circular walk in the forested landscape north of Oberweningen, located relatively close to Zurich. The trip shouldn’t be very demanding so that we can slow down and enjoy chatting together.</p> <h2 id="connections">Connections:</h2> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,&#43;gEAAwEBAQEBAQEBAQAAAAAAAAECAwQFBgcICQoLEQACAQIEBAMEBwUEBAABAncAAQIDEQQFITEGEkFRB2FxEyIygQgUQpGhscEJIzNS8BVictEKFiQ04SXxFxgZGiYnKCkqNTY3ODk6Q0RFRkdISUpTVFVWV1hZWmNkZWZnaGlqc3R1dnd4eXqCg4SFhoeIiYqSk5SVlpeYmZqio6Slpqeoqaqys7S1tre4ubrCw8TFxsfIycrS09TV1tfY2dri4&#43;Tl5ufo6ery8/T19vf4&#43;fr/2gAMAwEAAhEDEQA/APO4mRZ5ldGKqPkVAg5&#43;pU1TcRqSPLkVx6sCM/lTRcTL92aQfRjSm4nZSrTSFTwQWOKAGu5cgtjOOwAptKWJ6knHApKAP//Z); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_d7ecfb7b1dcd0b38.webp 1053w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_d7ecfb7b1dcd0b38.webp 1053w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_ab1466635e73105.webp 640w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_3bb0d56f13b1c6f4.webp 1024w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1053px) 100vw, 1053px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_3edc8916de2cc33d.jpg 1053w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_3edc8916de2cc33d.jpg 1053w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_de74de89dbb9f7cb.jpg 640w, /images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_8902d9348f5858c0.jpg 1024w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1053px) 100vw, 1053px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2025-05-24-walk-oberweningen/connection_hu_3edc8916de2cc33d.jpg"                  width="1053"                  height="501"                                                                                     /></picture> <p>There is a direct train back to Zurich every 30 minutes. The actual time will depend on the route and our pace. You will need a ticket for 4 ZVV zones. One way costs up to 9.20 Fr. depending on your abos.</p>
UID:20250524T105200-walk-oberweningen@cssz.ch
