DTEND:20250524T170000
LOCATION;ALTREP="https://maps.app.goo.gl/FsJRJDukk3GNd1gX7":Oberweningen
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/walk-oberweningen/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:VSETH Summer Bar
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/summerbar/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/FbBC5vRfJ8EM7FfN7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ETH Polyterrasse</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/eDXspzRcvFVs2zDm8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign up for helpers</a>\n\n<h1 id="summerbar-2025--helpers-needed">Summerbar 2025 – Helpers Needed!</h1> <p>We&rsquo;re teaming up with <strong>POLANA</strong> and <strong>Schwung</strong> to host the <strong>VSETH Summer Bar</strong> on the <strong>Polyterrasse</strong> – and we need your help to make it awesome!</p> <hr> <h2 id="volunteer-and-get-perks">Volunteer and Get Perks</h2> <p>To keep everything running smoothly, we’re looking for volunteers to help with:</p> <ul> <li>Setup</li> <li>Grill &amp; Bar</li> <li>Clean-up</li> </ul> <p>Each shift is <strong>3 hours</strong>, and as a thank-you, <strong>you’ll get free drinks during your shift and one free meal per shift</strong>.  You&rsquo;re welcome to do more than one shift if you like – we really appreciate your support!</p>
UID:20250515T150000-summerbar@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20250515T000000
DTSTART:20250515T150000
DTEND:20250515T220000
LOCATION;ALTREP="https://maps.app.goo.gl/FbBC5vRfJ8EM7FfN7":ETH Polyterrasse
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/summerbar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Board Game Evening
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/board-game-evening/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.uniability.uzh.ch/static/current/buildings/RAA/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UZH, RAA-E-12</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Matěj Mrázek (<a class="link" href="mailto:mrazekmates@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mrazekmates@gmail.com</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;420734643958">+420734643958</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScmjSI0wbKnePylLNyLrSoDiK26ei1xIth-Lkp_sVwMg1TXaA/viewform?usp=sharingGNnUekmLfLSjyrw/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p>Join us for a fun and exciting evening of card and board games on <strong>Wednesday, May 14, 2024</strong>, from <strong>18:00 to 22:00</strong>. Everybody is welcome, whether experienced players or somebody who wants to stroll in for a card game, a beer, and a chat.</p> <h2 id="the-games"><strong>The Games</strong></h2> <p>The following games will be available (we will update the list as more people choose to bring their own):</p> <ul> <li>Dobble</li> <li>6 takes! (6 nimmt!)</li> <li>Dice</li> <li>Cabo</li> <li>Bananagrams</li> <li>Werewolves</li> <li>Secretly Hitler</li> <li>Blood on the Clocktower</li> <li>Poker/Mariáš cards</li> </ul> <p>No prior experience needed - we will be sure to explain the rules before each game!</p>
UID:20250514T180000-board-game-evening@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20250514T000000
DTSTART:20250514T180000
DTEND:20250514T220000
LOCATION;ALTREP="https://www.uniability.uzh.ch/static/current/buildings/RAA/":UZH, RAA-E-12
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/board-game-evening/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Movie Night
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/movienight-spring25/\n<strong>Location:</strong> UZH RAA-G-15\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n\n<h3 id="movie-night-černák">Movie Night: Černák</h3> <p>Join us in watching the 2025 Slovak film Černák, directed by Jakub Kroner. It is a gritty crime thriller chronicling Miki Černák&rsquo;s ruthless ascent from a small-town gangster to Slovakia&rsquo;s most feared mafia boss, ultimately clashing with the nation&rsquo;s political elite and secret services.</p> <p><strong>No registration needed. Just come and enjoy.</strong></p> <p><strong>The movie starts at 19:00.</strong></p>
UID:20250506T184500-movienight-spring25@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20250506T000000
DTSTART:20250506T184500
DTEND:20250506T210000
LOCATION:UZH RAA-G-15
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/movienight-spring25/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Mid-semester lunch in Untere mensa
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/mensa-spring25/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/H1iUeh2DAa6N7djf6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mercato Mensa A (untere Mensa)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>)\n\n<p>What a time saver! Meet your favourite people while you would be eating anyway!</p> <p>Join us for a brief lunch in the mensa. We&rsquo;ll be there from 13:00 to 14:00. Invite your friends to join, too!</p>
