ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:CSSZ Ski Day at Flumserberg 🎿🏔️
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/ski-day-flumserberg/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.bergfex.ch/flumserberg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Flumserberg</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Michal Krkoška (<a class="link" href="mailto:michal.krkoska@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">michal.krkoska@cssz.ch</a>), Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/ZjLafkY97wSYoxAZA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form</a>\n\n<p>Join us for an exciting ski day at Flumserberg, just 1 hour from Zurich! With 65 km of slopes and stunning panoramic views, Flumserberg is the perfect spot for a one-day ski adventure. Whether you&rsquo;re a beginner or an expert, this is a great opportunity to hit the slopes and enjoy the snow with fellow students! ⛷️❄️</p> <h2 id="meeting-point--travel">Meeting Point &amp; Travel</h2> <p>All participants must book their own tickets. We meet at <strong>6:50 AM at Zurich HB, Platform 8.</strong> ⏰ Be on time! The train is often full, and it&rsquo;s best to board early to get a seat.</p>
UID:20250308T065000-ski-day-flumserberg@cssz.ch
