SUMMARY:Ice Skating
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/ice-skating/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.doldersports.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dolder Kunsteisbahn</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>), Aleš Kubiček (<a class="link" href="mailto:ales.kubicek@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ales.kubicek@cssz.ch</a>), Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/DXVjxDB4XaT1kEpcRI4FK5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join WhatpApp group</a>\n\n<h3 id="join-us-for-ice-skating-at-dolder-kunsteisbahn">Join us for ice skating at Dolder Kunsteisbahn!</h3> <p><strong>Price</strong> Admission for adults: 8 CHF Ice skates : 8 CHF (you can of course use your own)</p> <p><strong>We don not collect any admission, everything has to be paid individually at the entry.</strong></p> <p>Join us for a fun-filled ice skating afternoon at the iconic Dolder Kunsteisbahn on Saturday, 14th December 2024, from 16:00 to 18:00! Whether you&rsquo;re a seasoned skater or a beginner, everyone is welcome to join in the fun. See you on the ice!</p>
