SUMMARY:Lunch in Untere mensa
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/mensa-autumn24/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/H1iUeh2DAa6N7djf6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mercato Mensa A (untere Mensa)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>), Max Kellenberger (<a class="link" href="mailto:max.kellenberger@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">max.kellenberger@cssz.ch</a>)\n\n<p>What a time saver! Meet your favourite people while you would be eating anyway!</p> <p>Join us for a brief lunch in the mensa. We&rsquo;ll be there from 12:30 to 13:30. Invite your friends to join, too!</p> <p><em>To find the group, <a class="link" href="https://wa.me/&#43;421907240239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">message Juraj on WhatsApp</a></em></p> <hr> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,&#43;gEAAwEBAQEBAQEBAQAAAAAAAAECAwQFBgcICQoLEQACAQIEBAMEBwUEBAABAncAAQIDEQQFITEGEkFRB2FxEyIygQgUQpGhscEJIzNS8BVictEKFiQ04SXxFxgZGiYnKCkqNTY3ODk6Q0RFRkdISUpTVFVWV1hZWmNkZWZnaGlqc3R1dnd4eXqCg4SFhoeIiYqSk5SVlpeYmZqio6Slpqeoqaqys7S1tre4ubrCw8TFxsfIycrS09TV1tfY2dri4&#43;Tl5ufo6ery8/T19vf4&#43;fr/2gAMAwEAAhEDEQA/AKVz4i1DTbCK4a2DJO6eWV3Fg4VgB7HAHPfFM1LxLfW97aCaaO4aQFNySlgNyAkHJ9hz/Oreo2upm6lihSwurZAphS7DgKcDn5fQfz7Vzmt3VjbXcltf&#43;YjpHGYprZc7XwMnaxxg/wAutYqq3p1OiVGKd7aHWxeONZhXDXtvGWw&#43;37LvxkA9S2ffFP8A&#43;E&#43;1f/oI2/8A4Ar/APFV5HLqUk8hkLOGb73PemfbZP77/nV2n3JUqX8p/9k=); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2024-02-27-mensa-spring24-1/PXL_20240227_115742247_hu_7fb863e7256d13a1.webp 3280w, /images/events/2024-02-27-mensa-spring24-1/PXL_20240227_115742247_hu_7fb863e7256d13a1.webp 3280w, /images/events/2024-02-27-mensa-spring24-1/PXL_20240227_115742247_hu_528d583c59d3240a.webp 640w, /images/events/2024-02-27-mensa-spring24-1/PXL_20