SUMMARY:StradivariFEST Antonín Dvořák
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/stradivarifest-concert-2/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/aJWWkFES1q2CGvtv9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florhof (MKZ) - Grosser Saal</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/1jdudLCPcJCHCQiXA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p><strong>We have four free tickets for the first four people who register. If you qualify for a free ticket you will be contacted by email!</strong></p> <p><strong>Price for students</strong>: 10 CHF</p> <p>The StradivariFEST is organising a concert with works by the Czech composer Antonín Dvořák.  <a class="link" href="https://stradivarifest.com/klangwellen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://stradivarifest.com/klangwellen/</a></p> <p><strong>DVORAK 6</strong>  Streichquintett in Es-Dur, op. 97  Streichsextett in A-Dur, op. 48</p> <p>Zürich | Musikschule Konservatorium Zürich | Grosser Saal  Sunday, 26.05.2024  16.15 - Prélude  17.00 - Concert</p>
