SUMMARY:Hike + Grill around Gräppelensee
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/hike-and-grill/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://grillstelle.ch/grillstellen/1456/graeppelensee-9657-alt-st-johann-switzerland/uebersicht" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Grill place at Gräppelensee</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Aleš Kubiček (<a class="link" href="mailto:ales.kubicek@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ales.kubicek@cssz.ch</a>), Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/p5ozBufCfV2HtvpFA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• Important: Date has changed due to possibility of rain - further changes may occur.\n\n<p>CSSZ invites you and your friends to join a grill event on a hike!</p> <h2 id="connection">Connection</h2> <ul> <li> <p><strong>There:</strong> 08:40 - 10:42 (<a class="link" href="https://www.sbb.ch/en?date=%222024-05-12%22&amp;moment=%22DEPARTURE%22&amp;selected_trip=1&amp;stops=%5B%7B%22value%22%3A%228503000%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22ID%22%2C%22label%22%3A%22Z%C3%BCrich%20HB%22%7D%2C%7B%22value%22%3A%228506788%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22ID%22%2C%22label%22%3A%22Unterwasser%2C%20Post%22%7D%5D&amp;time=%2208%3A00%22" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zurich HB → Unterwasser, Post</a>)</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAARCAIAAABSJhvpAAACDElEQVR4nHxTwY7TMBCdsZ04bhNlUUpZIaEVJz6RMx&#43;HhDhw4Ac4LGKl3VZL6iSNvbYH2W5KYQUvJ2vmzXt5Hgsiur&#43;/R8S6rq21xlrOeQjh5WYDz7Db7ZxzUkpEbNtWAMA0TYhojCGA4zhWUiLnRAQAiLgQ42eMGcdRKSWljNXcBADzNHz99rP9&#43;Ond8IP6I354v1D&#43;CSSiEAIAaH0YJjPv9zUDH4htuqau13VNRGd9Soi0hGibMZYKsKqK8KJFpejpSR8OxphKKc75onTiLKdke7fbEZEQwntvjQUgpVTdNERUFMVlt7V2v98LIaSUTdNEZZ7iaZpmnudspJSyKIqF8huMsWwkT0Tvfbb9HDmLS1x2hhCibSLq&#43;14IobXu&#43;369Xnvvm6bpuu4yLWvt7e1tVVXW2uvra6UUxgGpnCzwGFwinDnnuwQA5xxLQIyqkfzw8BBC2G5fjYOejWGM5fsLIVRV1bbtwo1pz/Pc931ZlldXVyKfQwha91qP0zQpVRGRc857ny1EETytk/f&#43;8fGxbdtTIQ2F43H4/OW7ezq&#43;ea1ubt7mBfw/4rysoPVhOhp90KtVlXNmC7z3RVEkU2q73Z6Yl8rDMGh9IDrdUNd1Sqn882fbiPjHwhHR3d2dTS8xPo955pw75/LObDabuq6X5r8hAEApJYRYrVYhBCFE9lmWJSJebsVz/BoA5PtQFexLrrIAAAAASUVORK5CYII=); background-size: cover; display: inline;">               <source srcset='/images/events/2024-05-05-hike-and-grill/sbb1_hu_73b220c324666966.webp 457w, /images/events/2024-05-05-hike-and-grill/sbb1_hu_73b220c324666966.webp 457w'                       sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px"                       type="image/webp"               /><source srcset='/images/events/2024-05-05-hike-and-grill/sbb1_hu_bc1fa5572f7efedc.jpg 457w, /images/events/2024-05-05-hike-and-grill/sbb1_hu_bc1fa5572f7efedc.jpg 457w'                       sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px"                       type="image/jpeg"               /><img src="/images/events/2024-05-05-hike-and-grill/sbb1_hu_bc1fa5572f7efedc.jpg"                    width="457"                    height="382"                                                                                               /></picture> </li> <li> <p><strong>Back:</strong> based on our actual hiking time, around 17:00 - 18:00 back at Zürich HB</p> </li> </ul> <h2 id="planned-route">Planned route</h2> <ul> <li>10:42 - 12:10 Walk to grill place</li> <li>Grill</li> <li>14:00 - 15:20 Walk to Alt St. Johann, Dorf</li> </ul> <p><strong>Total distance:</strong> 12km  <strong>Expected duration:</strong> 4h  <strong>Uphill/downhill:</strong> 525m  <strong>Difficulty:</strong> Easy</p>
