ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Liquor Tasting 🥃
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/liquor-tasting/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/EATGGCHqgoyu4a9t9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CAB D21</a> (the big space in the basement)\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>), Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://zurich.esn.ch/event/2946" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESN Zurich</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• <p>Updates:</p> <ul> <li><a class="link" href="https://zurich.esn.ch/event/2946" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration through ESN</a> is now open!</li> <li>We no longer accept bottles for free entry (the last collection is over)</li> </ul>\n\n<p>CSSZ invites you to a big food and liquor tasting event. Members of the association as well as non-members are equally welcome to join. We&rsquo;ll be tasting a variety of Czech, Slovak and Polish liquor specialties, including:</p> <ul> <li>Czech and Slovak liquor: Slivovice, Becherovka, TATRATEA, Fernet, Božkov, Magister, and many more</li> <li>Czech beer on tap</li> <li>a selection of Polish alcohol: Zoladkowa Gorzka, Zubrovka, Krupnik, Soplica, Bialy Bocian</li> <li>a selection of wine from the Czech region of Moravia and the Slovak region of Tokaj Some snacks will be provided, too.</li> </ul> <p>This event is organised in collaboration with <strong>ESN Zürich</strong>, and <a class="link" href="https://www.instagram.com/polana.zurich/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Polana</a>.</p>
UID:20240430T190000-liquor-tasting@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20240430T000000
DTSTART:20240430T190000
DTEND:20240430T220000
LOCATION;ALTREP="https://maps.app.goo.gl/EATGGCHqgoyu4a9t9":CAB D21
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/liquor-tasting/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Brave hike through Glarus Alps 🥾🏔️
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/brave-hike-glarus-alps/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://en.mapy.cz/s/jesapohofu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Engi to Filzbach</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/HjqrWxx82X2uRNfP7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• Due to snow and weather conditions we are changing the hike to a different location. Join <a class="link" href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/Dhd5xtmG19tJMQmwEmhUZ5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">this whatsapp group</a> to stay updated.\n\n<p>Do you have too much energy and want to spend it in the mountains? Then this hike is for you! We will start in Engi and hike through the Glarus Alps to Filzbach.</p> <p>The hike is estimated to be very <strong>difficult</strong>, so be prepared for a challenging day with a faster pace. We will meet at the Zurich HB at 8:00 and take the train to Engi. Since the starting and ending point are different, taking a shorter route on the day is not possible. Don&rsquo;t forget to bring enough water and food for the day.</p>
UID:20240414T080000-brave-hike-glarus-alps@cssz.ch
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTAMP:20240414T000000
DTSTART:20240414T080000
DTEND:20240414T203000
LOCATION;ALTREP="https://en.mapy.cz/s/jesapohofu":Engi to Filzbach
URL:https://cssz.ch/events/brave-hike-glarus-alps/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Lunch in Polymensa
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/polymensa-spring24-2/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/2CJVFcinFu8wFiJQ8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mensa Polyterrasse</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>)\n\n<p>What a time saver! Meet your favourite people while you would be eating anyway!</p> <p>Join us for a brief lunch in the Polyterrasse Mensa. We&rsquo;ll be there from 13:00 to 14:00. Invite your friends to join, too!</p> <p><em>To find the group, <a class="link" href="https://wa.me/&#43;421907240239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">message Juraj on WhatsApp</a></em></p>
