DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/stradivarifest-concert/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/pKG4cJd23h1rSQYr8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kunsthaus Zürich</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Zdeněk Šnajdr (<a class="link" href="mailto:zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zdenek.snajdr@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762254840">+41762254840</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/53T459kiKVssUwgH9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p><strong>Price for students</strong>: 10 CHF</p> <p>The StradivariFEST is organising a concert with works by the Czech composer Antonín Dvořák.  <a class="link" href="https://stradivarifest.com/klangwellen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://stradivarifest.com/klangwellen/</a></p> <p><strong>DVORAK 5</strong>  Serenade für Streicher in E-Dur, op. 22  Slawisce Tänze, op. 46/72</p> <p>Zürich | Kunsthaus Zürich | Chipperfield-Bau | Festsaal  Sunday, 17.3.2024  16.15 - Prélude with Urs Mattenberger  17.00 - Concert</p> <p><strong>Meetup at 16:30 in front of the Kunsthaus entrance.</strong></p> <p>Buy the ticket yourself on the official website.</p>
