ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:SWISS Ice Hockey Games 🏒 (SUI vs CZE)
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/swiss-ice-hockey-games/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/KEacxidfHCJcEDXp9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Swiss Life Arena</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>), Aleš Kubiček (<a class="link" href="mailto:ales.kubicek@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ales.kubicek@cssz.ch</a>)\n\n<p><strong>Ticket Purchase:</strong> You can buy your tickets <a class="link" href="https://www.sihf.ch/de/events/ticketmaster" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a> (ticketmaster). We recommend the student-friendly priced tickets (35 CHF) available in sector H (standing). Tickets also include an earlier match Finland vs. Sweden (day ticket).</p> <p>To join us for this event, simply purchase your ticket and meet us at the Swiss Life Arena on December 16th. It&rsquo;s a great opportunity to connect with fellow Czech and Slovak students, cheer for your favorite team, and experience the thrill of live ice hockey.</p>
