ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Cold Water Dipping in Katzensee 🏊 & Protein Pancakes 🥞
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/cold-water-dipping-katzensee/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/sLzGELWx2HErX9Px5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Katzensee</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>), Emma Hubeková (<a class="link" href="mailto:emma.hubekova@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">emma.hubekova@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;421949776209">+421 949 776 209</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/+421907240239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Let Juraj know</a>\n\n<p>| Ever wondered how cold a lake can get in November? Survivable – try for yourself 😉</p> <p>Join us for an awesome and refreshing morning! We will meet at 9.15 at Katzensee and take a short dip in the lake. Just after the lake we will move to Juraj&rsquo;s place at <a class="link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/AjQWG4DPyCUNycLUA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bächlerstrasse 44</a> to enjoy some protein pancakes and hot tea.</p> <p>For those scared a little bit: The dip is not as terrible as it sounds. You can stay for as long as works for you, from just a couple seconds to minutes. If you don&rsquo;t mind being looked down on, you can also just skip the dip waiting us on the shore and join us for the pancakes afterward 😉.</p>
