BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Semester Welcome Event (Autumn 2023)
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/welcome-event-autumn23/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/bqDsM5dpDLDDRoGg8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bQm Culture Café & Bar</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>)\n\n<p>Join us for a lively kick-off to the Autumn semester 2023 at the <strong>bQm</strong> bar 🍻, where the Czech and Slovak Students in Zurich will host a warm welcome event 🌟. This meetup provides an excellent opportunity for both new and existing students to come together, connect, and make friends 🤝. Don&rsquo;t miss this chance to expand your social circle and make lasting memories with fellow students. We look forward to seeing you there! 🎉</p>
