URL:https://cssz.ch/events/general-meeting-fs23/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Cambridge <> Zurich Exchange
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/cambridge-zurich-exchange/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/9LEBPFM8ZyfotawJ6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cambrige, UK</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>), Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/4LBqwbPfhBqG23SE6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Application Form</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• UPDATE: Selection has been announced. The date of Cambridge students coming to Zurich will be changed. First part of exchange (in Cambridge) stays in May as planned.\n\n<p>Collaboration between <a class="link" href="https://cucss.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Cambridge University Czech and Slovak Society (CUCSS)</strong></a> and <strong>Czech and Slovak Students in Zurich (CSSZ)</strong> brings an opportunity for members of the two societies to visit the other city.</p> <p>Each of the two societies chooses <strong>8 members</strong> to be part of the programme, who will then be paired based on interests. Participants of this programme will host their paired peer (a member of CUCSS) in Zurich for 4 days in exchange to be hosted in Cambridge.</p>
