SUMMARY:Wine Tasting 🍷
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/wine-tasting/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/2JV26xf42Un76h5o8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Holderbachweg 6</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n\n<blockquote> <p><em>CZ:</em> <strong>Degustace vína:</strong> V sobotu degustace vína, ať se nám to hýbá, po červeném se zpívá, po bílém se stmívá, přijď a nebuď kůže lína, máme tady litry vína.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><em>EN:</em> <strong>Wine Tasting:</strong> Wine tasting on Saturday, let&rsquo;s keep it moving, after the red it sings, after the white it gets dark, come and don&rsquo;t be lazy, we have litres of wine.</p> </blockquote>
