SUMMARY:Baking Christmas Cookies
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/cookies/\n<strong>Location:</strong> UZH Kol-K-Küche\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Daniel Mareda (<a class="link" href="mailto:daniel.mareda@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">daniel.mareda@gmail.com</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/Efam3mejYc8JaD2i6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p>We invite you to come in these stressful times and get your deserved reward. Enjoy the two most important things about christmas: Gingerbread and Hotwine. We will bake the traditional christmas cookies, decorate them and drink some hot wine on side. Entry 5CHF.</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAHCAIAAACHqfpvAAABEElEQVR4nJRQMU/zMBC9u8RJGjft9y0MDIhuqP//L7CwgwRMwIDUipI4Tlpi3x1ypCIx8mz52X56fr7LdQaAwoxECoh43gICJgHSJQszc2GKdAZI5tbtOYYszxEwxkCUISFhJsKRg63XnfeNbZb10nnX&#43;&#43;7q8lpVEZHSC6pIlBIwLaISQ4AUDiKiIk8vD&#43;/7NwDYH3bPr49wRo6IVWlZ4vwvaOz/RLMWY/hnzDCODNM4eRH56Hb96TCMg62tguJc8JwOEGNsXWfr2g2OgI7hJCy2qlfNiohc393d32o2bS62N5stIv6Y02xd64&#43;&#43;NKUpTGUqVh7GoTTlulmn1vSfX&#43;FUGGOyclEtMsp/mf86vgcADvqaOKHYSl8AAAAASUVORK5CYII=); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_9a4c82ed89ad5804.webp 4452w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_9a4c82ed89ad5804.webp 4452w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_724a96fbf56ebcff.webp 640w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_a8a4fd85664e4a80.webp 1024w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_3d734f8c73ec4ea7.webp 1600w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_5bb917d115412285.webp 2000w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_fb344faf9c3ed652.webp 4000w'                     sizes="(max-width: 4452px) 100vw, 4452px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_291ff9c06dea2571.jpg 4452w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_291ff9c06dea2571.jpg 4452w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_a833dc1c685e2d0e.jpg 640w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_7e9ab26879b3022e.jpg 1024w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_309996e89976e0f0.jpg 1600w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_aa7c9ab0a2c783cb.jpg 2000w, /images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_86fd61d30f974050.jpg 4000w'                     sizes="(max-width: 4452px) 100vw, 4452px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2022-12-19-cookies/cookies_hu_291ff9c06dea2571.jpg"                  width="4452"                  height="1622"                                                                                     /></picture>
