SUMMARY:Meet'n'Dine
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/meet-n-dine-2/\n<strong>Location:</strong> University of Zurich, KOL-K-Küche\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://zurich.esn.ch/index.php?file=addViewEventsRegister.php&evId=2642" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESN Zürich</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• This event was rescheduled from 19. Oct to 9. Nov due to venue availability.\n\n<p>CSSZ and <a class="link" href="https://www.notion.so/jjurm/Meet-n-Dine-c0d588aaa93046fe9724599c9ee62976" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meet&rsquo;n&rsquo;Dine</a> invite you to a casual dinner with fellow students in the cosy environment of a student flat. Come join us and bring a friend!</p> <p>We&rsquo;ll be cooking a traditional Slovak dish: <em>Bryndzové halušky</em>. Stay tuned and follow this page for further details.</p> <p>See the previous event of the Meet&rsquo;n&rsquo;Dine series <a class="link" href="https://cssz.ch/events/meet-n-dine/">here</a>.</p>
