SUMMARY:Hike 🥾 from Uetliberg to Thalwil
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/hike-uetliberg-thalwil/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/LAgraK7pxk82yfbe7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zurich Triemli</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Emma Hubeková (<a class="link" href="mailto:emma.hubekova@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">emma.hubekova@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;421949776209">+421 949 776 209</a>), Vu Nguyen (<a class="link" href="mailto:vu.nguyen@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">vu.nguyen@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762800264">+41762800264</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfL6-gjaGNdOr1Ijl3vDFkh4wXbmOZ_qGM2vC5ujJOXwTFfCA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<p>Thank You everyone for joining us! You can see some photos from the hike below or the album <a class="link" href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/5VGVbvPTzKh7zBF26" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here!</a></p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAOCAIAAACgpqunAAADY0lEQVR4nABWA6n8BMrDqwoFAf78&#43;wQFCwcFAf0AAvD09/748Ozw8isgFej2BO709iIZFgH&#43;/fj6AQ8PFObk1PH19P0DCPb5&#43;gTs7Oz8//4pISbo8PHt8u4iGRgcEAP&#43;AhsZFhb89/Dy9ffz9vvk7u8IAf0IBP7n7PAOEBQXDAXo&#43;AUAAvUCAP/68vgB9fj&#43;DQ4V9/b52&#43;Pm&#43;PYC&#43;/j4/fjw3uPuEQT/GRAI9O3x5&#43;zz6fT9AwEE8f4M/AgVCP7x&#43;vXyAgwRFQ8ODO/y8g0IAx0QDwb/Ac/X6fnz/AYHBgsaIhgVD/r5&#43;wD7/gQFAQP/BPf399f6F872GvwGCxoVDANQUD36/QQfGR7v7ubv9fQBAgDu8Pn8EA0H/vbbASf4/wYcDv8FDQ0DAQYEBQgKBwgB&#43;PDnCi3/&#43;O0ZCwMCDwcEAvru7/TwFRcgEgkAEg0IERIL4Nrj/gEEDgb/1Psh8vkD6&#43;zsDw0LFRQW9gAIGgoDKwLbBhQtCwsTAvX4/PsBAu7x6Onr4ev09gQE/wYKCAYKB/f2&#43;Rv&#43;5QT99&#43;v9DwH&#43;/Obq7vrz7Ab99v4DBQ787vX6/tn4EgIDCA4A/wALBP3e4d0CAPv8/f/6/v8HEBEABg0G&#43;vASAe/s&#43;Q0bCQoABAL&#43;AwcQDgv6&#43;fADAf8jAN8P9tQCDggBCgYB6/L0FA4LCg4U7fX5HhQNCAYN7/X69fv7Gf3l8AsZ8wwaGxIU&#43;Pv/9fwE3uzw6/HwAvjm7/PxAvv//wkKDg4KDyAcJAYGEPf7A/